貌雄壮，博学多识，星历、算数无不该览","evidence":["yululu-q-70d3fd36d7216e7e4ba9"]},{"id":"yululu-f-ceb3f55aa19699428bd9","text":"既有躄疾，又意存儒雅，非其志也","evidence":["yululu-q-36c9136247bc450511e5"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"pangfa-m-o003-pangfa-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o003"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-p002-pangfa-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-p002"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o001-pangfa-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o001"]},{"id":"yululu-m-cc12c27a17a68066f00c","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及陆绩，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-9923c61a92d7754be290"]},{"id":"yululu-m-231c3466d1c62c302c58","kind":"mention","text":"评曰：之于扬《玄》，是仲尼之左丘明、老聃之严周；以瑚琏之器而作守南越，不亦贼夫人欤","evidence":["yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-q-o001","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ff4b69fec63fc12556eb","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊字伯言，吴郡吴人也。本名议。世江东大族〖1〗。﹝一﹞逊少孤，随从祖庐江太守康在官〖2〗。袁术与康有隙，将攻康；康遣逊及亲戚还吴：逊年长于康子绩数岁，为之纲纪门户〖3〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-o003b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-906efa25edd07a3c9958","layer":"original","quote":"吴人多闻其名，及当西还，并会昌门〖11〗：陆绩、顾邵、全琮皆往〖12〗。统曰：“陆子可谓驽马有逸足之力〖13〗，顾子可谓驽牛能负重致远也。”﹝二﹞谓全琮曰：“卿好施慕名〖14〗，有似汝南樊子昭；﹝三﹞虽智力不多，亦一时之佳也。”绩、邵谓统曰：“使天下太平〖15〗，当与卿共料四海之士〖16〗。”深与统相结而还。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o003","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-906efa25edd07a3c9958","layer":"original","quote":"吴将周瑜助先主取荆州，因领南郡太守。瑜卒，统送丧至吴。吴人多闻其名，及当西还，并会昌门〖11〗：陆绩、顾邵、全琮皆往〖12〗。统曰：“陆子可谓驽马有逸足之力〖13〗，顾子可谓驽牛能负重致远也。”﹝二﹞谓全琮曰：“卿好施慕名〖14〗，有似汝南樊子昭；﹝三﹞虽智力不多，亦一时之佳也。”绩、邵谓统曰：“使天下太平〖15〗，当与卿共料四海之士〖16〗。”深与统相结而还。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-p002","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-61b9797ee634a05e0eec","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞张勃《吴录》曰：“或问统曰：‘如所目，陆子为胜乎？’统曰：‘驽马虽精，所致一人耳；驽牛一日行三十里，所致岂一人之重哉！’邵就统宿，语，因问：‘卿名知人，吾与卿孰愈？’统曰：‘陶冶世俗，甄综人物，吾不及卿；论帝王之秘策，揽倚伏之要最，吾似有一日之长。’邵安其言而亲之。”","attribution":"张勃《吴录》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-084422541bf4a70a5315","start":0,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-164693a744fcd0f873e0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-872a9bd72cf9cdbe3b15","layer":"original","quote":"又瑁从父绩早亡，二男一女，皆数岁以还〖5〗；瑁迎摄养〖6〗，至长乃别","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":115,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-18c45f546e04cc3df154","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-62c56bac35051367c263","layer":"original","quote":"孙权统事，辟为奏曹掾","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-1d4e9de01994ac06de62","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-630abd3f57091a228d6a","layer":"original","quote":"绩年少末坐，遥大声言曰：“昔管夷吾相齐桓公〖3〗，九合诸侯〖4〗，一匡天下〖5〗：不用兵车。孔子曰：‘远人不服，则修文德以来之〖6〗。’今论者不务道德怀取之术，而惟尚武；绩虽童蒙，窃所未安也！”昭等异焉","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-27c15dcac6a464711c49","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-aa002892a71ea961cb20","layer":"original","quote":"陆绩字公纪，吴郡吴人也。父康，汉末为庐江太守。﹝一﹞","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-36c9136247bc450511e5","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-b48e5d369548768a9787","layer":"original","quote":"绩既有躄疾〖12〗，又意（在）〔存〕儒雅，非其志也。虽有军事，著述不废。作《浑天图》〖13〗，注《易》释《玄》〖14〗，皆传于世。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-52649b54557744bbce28","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9e108a4c96cf9d44af98","layer":"original","quote":"虞翻旧齿名盛〖8〗；庞统荆州令士〖9〗，年亦差长〖10〗：皆与绩友善","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-69af196f6a6765505fc9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-65ae20759ac764888750","layer":"original","quote":"绩年六岁，于九江见袁术。术出橘，绩怀三枚；去，拜辞，堕地。术谓曰：“陆郎，作宾客而怀橘乎？”绩跪答曰：“欲归遗母〖1〗。”术大奇之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-70d3fd36d7216e7e4ba9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9e108a4c96cf9d44af98","layer":"original","quote":"绩容貌雄壮；博学多识，星历、算数无不该览〖7〗。虞翻旧齿名盛〖8〗；庞统荆州令士〖9〗，年亦差长〖10〗：皆与绩友善。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-74ac0f32c0c4cfe7370f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-62c56bac35051367c263","layer":"original","quote":"以直道见惮，出为郁林太守，加偏将军，给兵二千人","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-848718c7e7a53dc4cc5f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-107564ced9ee2faca959","layer":"original","quote":"年三十二卒","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-85ccd8afc8c38d2ca150","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-b48e5d369548768a9787","layer":"original","quote":"虽有军事，著述不废。作《浑天图》〖13〗，注《易》释《玄》〖14〗，皆传于世","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-864e6075113eef277bbf","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ee4204e7cfed0469a0e0","layer":"original","quote":"预自知亡日，乃为辞曰：“有汉志（士）〔民〕，吴郡陆绩；幼敦《诗》、《书》〖15〗，长玩《礼》、《易》〖16〗。受命南征，遘疾遇厄；遭命不（幸）〔永〕〖17〗。呜呼悲隔！”又曰：“从今以去，六十年之外，车同轨〖18〗，书同文〖19〗。恨不及见也","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-9923c61a92d7754be290","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-872a9bd72cf9cdbe3b15","layer":"original","quote":"陆瑁字子璋。丞相逊弟也〖1〗。少好学笃义。陈国陈融、陈留濮阳逸、沛郡蒋纂、广陵袁迪等，皆单贫有志〖2〗，就瑁游处；﹝一﹞瑁割少分甘，与同丰约〖3〗。及同郡徐原，爰居会稽〖4〗，素不相识；临死遗书，托以孤弱。瑁为起立坟墓，收导其子。又瑁从父绩早亡，二男一女，皆数岁以还〖5〗；瑁迎摄养〖6〗，至长乃别。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-88aca22865401281bdfd","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：虞翻古之狂直〖1〗，固难免乎末世〖2〗；然权不能容，非旷宇也〖3〗！陆绩之于扬《玄》〖4〗，是仲尼之左丘明〖5〗，老聃之严周矣〖6〗；以瑚琏之器〖7〗，而作守南越〖8〗：不亦贼夫人欤〖9〗？张温才藻俊茂；而智防未备，用致艰患。骆统抗明大义〖10〗，辞切理至，值权方闭不开。陆瑁笃义规谏，君子有称焉。吾粲、朱据遭罹屯蹇〖11〗，以正丧身：悲夫！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":490,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
